<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Humphrey returns three months after his last visit, nine months after his operation and five weeks after his annual wellness visit. He takes sodium bicarbonate twice a day without stomach upset, and the late-afternoon tiredness has gone. He has had no fever, flank pain, or further infection, and no leaks; he changes the appliance every four days. He has had no bone pain, cough, weight loss, change in bowel habit, or rectal bleeding. He works full time and walks 30 minutes most days. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Acidosis</td><td>Tiredness resolved on sodium bicarbonate</td></tr><tr><td>Stoma</td><td>No leaks; skin healthy</td></tr><tr><td>Recurrence symptoms</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Working full time; walking daily</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

